OL,3,CArson suspect found dead in bin days
OL,4,Cafter fatal house fire
OL,6,FA man suspected of carrying out an
OL,7,Farson attack which killed an elderly
OL,8,Fcouple was found dead in a wheelie bin
OL,9,Fa week later, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FPaul Smith, known locally as
OL,12,F"Smigger", is believed to have
OL,13,Fdeliberately started a fire at the
OL,14,Fhome of Sheila Jackson, 83, and her
OL,15,Fpartner Eric Greener, 77, in July 2025.
OL,17,FThe couple were rescued from the
OL,18,Fblaze, in St Helens, Merseyside, but
OL,19,Fdied in hospital from burns and smoke
OL,20,Finhalation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
