FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785349119
OL,3,CArson suspect found dead in bin days
OL,4,Cafter fatal house fire
OL,6,FIn a report, Home Office pathologist
OL,7,FDr Matthew Lyall said toxicology
OL,8,Fresults showed Mr Smith had taken
OL,9,Fheroin close to the time of his death,
OL,10,Fas well as a "relatively large amount
OL,11,Fof cocaine" and a number of sedatives.
OL,13,FDr Lyall said drowning could not be
OL,14,Fproved or excluded. He added: "Neither
OL,15,Fcan it be entirely excluded that the
OL,16,Fdeceased was held under water by a
OL,17,Fthird party, but pathological findings
OL,18,Fcannot prove that occurred."
OL,26,@rD@NOUsD@KO]vD@_OUzD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
