PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785349119
OL,3,CArson suspect found dead in bin days
OL,4,Cafter fatal house fire
OL,6,FHe recorded the cause of death as
OL,7,Fmixed drug toxicity. The court heard
OL,8,Fthat police were satisfied the death
OL,9,Fwas not caused by criminality.
OL,11,FThe senior coroner said it was
OL,12,Funderstood there were criminal
OL,13,Fproceedings ongoing regarding the
OL,14,Fdisposal of the body.
OL,16,FRecording the death as drug-related,
OL,17,Fthe coroner said: "He died from taking
OL,18,Fillicit and and sedative drugs which
OL,19,Fcaused respiratory failure."
OL,26,@yD@SOU{D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
