PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785349119
OL,3,CArson suspect found dead in bin days
OL,4,Cafter fatal house fire
OL,6,FEarlier this year Kevin Weetman, 34,
OL,7,FKylie Maynard, 37, and Lee Owens, 46,
OL,8,Fwere jailed for the manslaughter of Mr
OL,9,FGreener and Ms Jackson.
OL,11,FA trial at Liverpool Crown Court heard
OL,12,Fthat Mr Smith had travelled with Owens
OL,13,Fto the home in South John Street just
OL,14,Fafter 12.30am on 15 July.
OL,16,FWeetman was jailed for life with a
OL,17,Fminimum of 25 years for planning the
OL,18,Fattack after Mrs Jackson's son George
OL,19,FJackson, 48, refused to sell drugs for
OL,20,Fhim.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
