PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785349119
OL,3,CArson suspect found dead in bin days
OL,4,Cafter fatal house fire
OL,6,FMaynard, said to be the "trusted
OL,7,Flieutenant" in Weetman's drugs line,
OL,8,Fwas jailed for 23 years and Owens was
OL,9,Fsentenced to 13 years and six months.
